# Game assets, and anything derived from them, are never committed to a public repo.
# Creation Kit licence (Chris, 2026-11-24): assets may be modified and distributed for use as mods in Fallout games, but not for other
# use, and posting them publicly on GitHub allows broader use. Commit the SCRIPT that makes an asset, never the asset.
# (If a file really is ours and safe, add it with `git add -f` and say why in the commit message.)

# textures, materials, meshes, archives, audio, video, animation
*.[Dd][Dd][Ss]
*.[Bb][Gg][Ss][Mm]
*.[Bb][Gg][Ee][Mm]
*.[Nn][Ii][Ff]
*.[Hh][Kk][Xx]
*.[Bb][Aa]2
*.[Bb][Ss][Aa]
*.[Tt][Gg][Aa]
*.[Ww][Aa][Vv]
*.[Xx][Ww][Mm]
*.[Ff][Uu][Zz]
*.[Bb][Ii][Kk]
*.[Ll][Oo][Dd]
# plugins (built outputs; they copy records from the Bethesda masters)
*.[Ee][Ss][Pp]
*.[Ee][Ss][Ll]
*.[Ee][Ss][Mm]
# images and screenshots (the game's pictures are the game's assets)
*.[Pp][Nn][Gg]
*.[Jj][Pp][Gg]
*.[Jj][Pp][Ee][Gg]
*.[Gg][Ii][Ff]
# extraction and output folders
/extracted/
/assets/
/Textures/
/Materials/
/Meshes/
/Sound/
/Data/
# raw dumps of game records and tool logs
out*.txt
build.log
xe.log
*.bak*
